Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.65,0:00:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This four-way duel is\Nconfusing. What's the score?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.45,0:01:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, so far, Joey's in the lead,\Nfollowed by Yugi in second place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you got Kaiba in third, and\NMerrick bringing up the reel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move, and I summon Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.61,0:01:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.85,0:01:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the weakest monster\Non the field, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.07,0:01:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Little does that fool realize that my\NDark Geroid has a very powerful ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.91,0:01:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as it's summoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it can lower the attack points\Nof any monster I choose by 800.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is, who should I annihilate?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.25,0:01:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If Maric attacks me, my Ring of Destruction\NTrap card will be ready for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to blast his monster into\Nthe next millennium, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.25,0:01:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that Seto Kaiba\Nhas set a trap for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in\Nattacking him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.09,0:01:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Crushing the Pharaoh is a much\Nmore appealing choice. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.09,0:02:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,even with its special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,my Dark Geroid isn't strong enough\Nto defeat his Beast of Guilfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.83,0:02:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That leaves just one target.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll attack Gierfried the Iron Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.25,0:02:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to Geroid's special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,your beast gets weaker by 800 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.91,0:02:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Skull Dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your monster's points\Nshrink depending on what I roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're relying on luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That means your monster's\Nattack points get cut in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.39,0:02:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for Geerfreed to strike back\Nand send your Geroid back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Geerfreed, take it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.23,0:03:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mini-Griffon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.27,0:03:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I used my face-down shrink card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So thanks to me, Wheeler's monster\Njust lost half its strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now his creature is as puny as his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.77,0:03:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Geroid, destroy\NGerefreed the Iron Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget that, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay focused, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.83,0:03:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that Kaiba\Njust helped Merrick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's about\Nas low as you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got something planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's timing on that\Nlast move was just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you guys,\Nbut I don't trust Kaiba at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.95,0:04:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're going up, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And in this duel, that's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.73,0:04:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You must maintain your concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's going to\Nrescue you soon, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.15,0:04:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's not going to let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He always comes through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's out there\Nfighting for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.90,0:04:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.83,0:04:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.73,0:04:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, which duelist should I attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.59,0:05:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has Blade Knight on\Nthe field in attack mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,plus two face-down cards\Nto protect himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek has Dark Geroid in play,\Nand so far he's in last place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I attack him, Kaiba\Nmay protect him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.69,0:05:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And poor Joey has no monsters\Non the field to shield himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the worst shape of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you guys stop staring at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So my defense has seen better days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.19,0:05:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to make sure that Joey\Ndoesn't end up dueling Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Kaiba and Merrick\Nfinish last, he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So I could attack Kaiba's Blade Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure he'd activate\None of his face-down cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.91,0:05:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That leaves only one choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.51,0:05:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's in a really tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.21,0:05:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,because his best bet is to duel Kaiba in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the semifinals and win\Nhis Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But that would mean Joey\Nwould have to face Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be a complete disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But by the look in Joey's\Neyes, he wants to duel Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.31,0:06:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys don't know the half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.29,0:06:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey told me his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks that by defeating Merrick, he\Ncan bring Mai back from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.13,0:06:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me so himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I couldn't help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.71,0:06:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I was five feet away when\Nthat psycho zapped her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.85,0:06:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and I promised that I'd protect her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.83,0:06:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.89,0:06:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you feel bad, but what\Nhappened to Mai isn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you trying to help,\Nbut I know what I have to do, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be careful, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.07,0:06:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maric is not someone\Nyou want to mess with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I know if I beat that evil\Nfreak in a duel, I can get Mai back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.27,0:06:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I have what it takes\Nto pull this off, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, I got you guys in my corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.09,0:06:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been more sure\Nof anything in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:06:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe it to Mai and to\Nmyself to face Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.41,0:07:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If I back away from this fight now,\NI'll never be able to forgive myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.91,0:07:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave Mai my word that I wouldn't\Nlet anything happen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And Joey Wheeler would never\Nbreak a promise to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So look out, Marek, because here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's pretty heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope he knows what\Nhe's doing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd hate to think of what'll\Nhappen if Joey faces Marek and loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.37,0:07:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my Beast of Guilfur, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your target is Marek's monster! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.99,0:07:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making a mistake, and I\Ncan't let you go through with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.49,0:07:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're attacking the wrong duelist, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be attacking Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be attacking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.59,0:07:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:07:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Joey thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:08:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say he's not thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey, I think the\Npressure's getting to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.53,0:08:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just relax and let Yugi make his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.71,0:08:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay out of it, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is something that\NI have to do, Yu-Gi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're just\Nlooking out for me, pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can't keep protecting\Nme for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never learn to improve my dueling\Nskills if you keep going easy on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.57,0:08:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.53,0:08:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason I came this\Nfar is because I faced
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the toughest opponents of\Nmy life in Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.73,0:08:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They dueled against me with everything they\Nhad, and I defeated them all on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,JINTO!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.71,0:08:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Esparova, but both of\Nyour monsters are history.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, and his duel is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I smelled a dung beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.61,0:09:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my greeting after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can summon a creature whose\Nattack power is virtually limitless!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.36,0:09:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Insect Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Insect Queen, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Annihilate his tiny guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You grub, I was hoping you\Nwould attack me. You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate the trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Grave robber!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.69,0:09:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not grave robber! Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He can take a card from your\Ngraveyard and use it against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And he just nabbed you a can of aerosol.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to exterminate your queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes my best problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to your fortress whale, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:10:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well I play this Return of the Doomed.\NIt brings back one of my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and hides it underwater i better\Nthink of something quick or i'm sunk
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,what on earth are you waiting for\Nhurry up and make your move so my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,creature of the deep can strike and\Nend this duel if i dry up mako's ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll uncover and weaken his\Nhidden monster, Giant Trunade!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You've exposed my final move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.05,0:10:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over now, just finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your chances of victory have vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, reveal Jinso!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I sacrifice my battle warrior in\Norder to summon the legendary fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:10:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice my alligator's sword and my\Nswordsman of Landstar so I can summon this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.65,0:11:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,my insect queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.07,0:11:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of my battle city\Nvictories is paying off right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Those duels got me three\Nincredible monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come a really long way since\Nthe Battle City tournament began.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,if I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want to help me, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.77,0:11:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,then treat me just like you\Nwould any other opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a four-way duel, and\Nit's everyone for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want any special treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.07,0:11:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to move onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.33,0:11:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's your move, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the middle of an\Nattack, so pick your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.99,0:11:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, if you really believe in me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,then you'll stop babysitting me and\Nstart treating me like you're equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Joey, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now, Yugi, no buts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no monsters to defend myself,\Nso your smartest move is to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:11:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,On the bright side, Joey does\Nhave the most life points so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but since Joey is\Ncompletely defenseless,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's Beast of Guilford will\Nblast him halfway up the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be in last place, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.09,0:12:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,if you hold back,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll know you don't think I could\Ntake it. I'm asking you as my
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.35,0:12:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,best friend to attack me. What if\Nyou lose? That may not be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.55,0:12:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember this tool only determines\Nwho faces who in the semi-finals And
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to face a certain someone to\Nkeep a promise I made to you and my
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always had my back so it's\Ntime I helped you for a change
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll whoop this merit creep and\Nhis rare hunter goon squad so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't know what hit him
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.21,0:12:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.71,0:12:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I let you down, Mai, but I\Npromise I'm gonna get you out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.63,0:12:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Beast of Guilford, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go straight for Joey's life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.01,0:13:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, never better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.35,0:13:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Hugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Blasting my lights out was the\Nnicest thing you've ever done for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.05,0:13:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in last place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm taking you down with me, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.89,0:13:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.47,0:13:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got closer to rescuing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey lost most of his life\Npoints to Yu-Gi's attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.57,0:13:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, folks. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.59,0:13:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This card is my ticket to making\Nsure I duel Maric in the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:14:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I beat him, I can save Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot your entry card, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.23,0:14:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving it to you so you\Ncan enter the next round. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do me one little\Nfavor out there, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Win that prize money for your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made it to the top again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Only this time, I'm dueling for you, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Axe Raider!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is his chance to\Nlaunch an attack on Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for me to attack a\Ncertain unlucky someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And I choose you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.43,0:14:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.85,0:14:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was after\NMerrick. Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.93,0:14:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So why did he direct his attack at Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.31,0:14:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be that Joey\Nfinally chickened out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:14:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless this is all part of his strategy to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.11,0:14:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,make sure he duels\NMerrick in the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no way Joey's\Nattack is gonna work, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto will just strike back by\Nactivating one of his face down cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Axe Raider!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Kaiba's blade knight, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.81,0:15:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Kaiba set a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll never work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.65,0:15:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You triggered my trap. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet my Ring of Destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It annihilates whatever monster wears\Nit, so your Axe Raider is history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And both players will\Nlose 1,700 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.57,0:15:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.01,0:15:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.61,0:15:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my Ring of Defense magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.81,0:15:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It shields me from the\Nblast of my trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.51,0:15:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring of Destruction, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.45,0:15:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean that all of\NJoey's life points are gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.53,0:16:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you you shouldn't\Nmess with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.79,0:16:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Something else is going on up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.83,0:16:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have my life points gone to zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just do? Play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.15,0:16:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A little card called Grave Robbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,During all the commotion,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,this little guy snuck into Merrick's\Ngraveyard and stole a card for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.87,0:16:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He grabbed the card that you used\Nagainst me a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Spell of Pain ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.17,0:16:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This card lets me transfer\Nmy damage to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.65,0:16:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thought I'd let you\Ntake the fall, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.45,0:16:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome move, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you were one step ahead\Nof everyone else for a change, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.33,0:16:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Joey! Keep it up! Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That was an awesome move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.69,0:16:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If Joey would have attacked Merrick's\NDark Geroid with his Axe Raider,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:16:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick would have only\Nlost 500 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:17:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So instead, Joey attacked Kaiba,\Nfiguring that Kaiba had a hidden trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And when Kaiba struck back,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey was able to redirect the damage at\NMarek, causing Marek to lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.03,0:17:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent strategy, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.83,0:17:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Yoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're on the\Nexpress elevator to Loserville.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Buh-bye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with you shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's out, and the next duelist\Nto lose faces him in the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I just gotta make sure that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Joey has no monsters\Nto protect himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.23,0:17:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, he has no face-down cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's my brother's turn, so I'd say\Nhe's in big trouble now. We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.23,0:17:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've done enough for right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna go ahead and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.83,0:17:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do quite a bit, so watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for. My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:18:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll always be a second-rate\Nduelist in my book, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Blade Knight, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.55,0:18:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.93,0:18:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm facing Marek now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That worked out for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.67,0:18:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Yugi's going up against Kaiba in the\Nnext round, and I can take down Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.35,0:18:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice meeting you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.69,0:18:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to enter the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.07,0:18:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this\Nfor a long time. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The semifinal bouts have\Nnow been determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.73,0:18:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like I'll be facing off\Nagainst Yugi in the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.13,0:18:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.11,0:18:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The first semifinal duel will be\NMerrick Ishtar against Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Followed by Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.31,0:18:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba against Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:19:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,One of us will get past the next\Nround, the other goes home a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to defeat Kaiba and\Nmake it to the final round!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The future of the entire\Nworld could depend on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.15,0:19:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the tower gates now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to proceed to\Nthe next dueling site!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.01,0:19:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you're ready to join your\Nfriend Mai in the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.55,0:19:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna crush you and\Nget her out of that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.35,0:19:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch the dueling platforms\Nto the top of the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.79,0:19:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And let the semifinals begin!
